WEBVTT

00:11:29.268 --> 00:11:34.440
They are building solidarity
across racial, ethnic,

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:36.692
religious, partisan divides.

00:11:37.401 --> 00:11:43.073
Martin Luther King [Jr.] exhorted us
to enwrap ourselves

00:11:43.115 --> 00:11:45.451
in a single garment of destiny.

00:11:46.285 --> 00:11:49.580
I have observed several unions
that I've studied

00:11:49.621 --> 00:11:53.333
build expanded and inclusive
communities of fate

00:11:53.333 --> 00:11:56.920
in which large numbers of others recognize

00:11:56.962 --> 00:12:00.174
that their destinies are entwined